  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renewable Energy Program #1 - Solar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to finance a 10 MW solar photovoltaic (PV) power plant in Mongolia and build the accredited entity&#x2019;s project financing capacities.

&#x2022; GCF is expected to unlock renewable energy investments in Mongolia and mobilize private sector capital.
&#x2022; The project is expected to be a precursor to the Asia Super Grid initiative.
&#x2022; It finances 2nd largest PV in Mongolia, contributing to diversification of renewable generation in water vulnerable population of Mongolia. 
&#x2022; The principle of minimum concessionality and empowering a direct access entity is applied
&#x2022; Given abundant and unuiltized RE sources, the potential for program replication in Mongolia is high.</narrative>
  </description>
